# Inferno viz design system

All visualizations under `app/static/` must follow `viz/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`, sourced from `app/static/inferno_cone.html` (“Nine Alphas of Evil”).

## Required tokens

```css
:root {
  --bg: #f6f3ee;
  --ink: #1a1612;
  --muted: #7a7268;
  --line: #e4ddd3;
  --no: #c45c4a;
  --no-dim: #e8b4aa;
  --yes: #3d8b6e;
  --yes-dim: #a8d4c2;
}
```

Fonts: **Newsreader** (titles), **Instrument Sans** (UI). Cream background only. Hairline `--line` dividers. YES/NO semantics use `--yes` / `--no`.

## Do not

- SAE-viz blue (`#1a56db`) / `#f4f4f4` / system-ui-only chrome for new viz
- Dark fantasy / gold Cinzel boards
- Purple-glow or multi-shadow card stacks

Read `viz/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` before creating or restyling any viz.
